<%- include('partials/header', { navigation }) %>

<h2>Information from a Node Package</h2>
<p>This page uses the <strong>@faker-js/faker</strong> Node package.</p>
<p>The package creates the example information below:</p>

<table>
  <tr><th>Name</th><td><%= person.name %></td></tr>
  <tr><th>Email</th><td><%= person.email %></td></tr>
  <tr><th>City</th><td><%= person.city %></td></tr>
  <tr><th>Favorite color</th><td><%= person.favoriteColor %></td></tr>
  <tr><th>Message</th><td><%= person.message %></td></tr>
</table>

<p>Refresh this page to see different package-generated information.</p>

